async function request(path:string,data?:unknown,method?:string){const r=await fetch(path,{method:method||(data?'POST':'GET'),headers:{...(data?{'Content-Type':'application/json'}:{}),...(typeof window!=='undefined'&&localStorage.getItem('owner-center')?{'X-Center-ID':localStorage.getItem('owner-center')!}:{})},body:data?JSON.stringify(data):undefined,cache:'no-store'});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error||'Please try again.');return d}
function applyAppearance(settings:User['settings']){const root=document.documentElement;root.dataset.style=settings.style;root.dataset.layout=settings.layout;if(settings.accent)root.style.setProperty('--accent',settings.accent);else root.style.removeProperty('--accent')}
function nextClass(g:Group){const now=new Date();const parts=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA',{timeZone:'Asia/Tashkent',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit'}).format(now);for(let i=0;i<8;i++){const day=new Date(parts+'T00:00:00+05:00');day.setUTCDate(day.getUTCDate()+i);const iso=new Date(day.getTime()+5*3600000).toISOString().slice(0,10);const at=new Date(iso+'T'+g.time+':00+05:00');if(g.days.includes(new Date(iso+'T12:00:00Z').getUTCDay())&&at>now)return at}return null}
